            "review_title": "Review at Cộng Ca Phe",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam\n12939 contributions\n46\nAuthentic Vietnamese Cafe with great Coffee\nSep 2024 • Friends\nAuthentic Vietnamese style cafe in District 2. Plenty of nice outdoor seating in the front gardens as well as extensive seating inside. My favourite is the bench seating overlooking the lush back garden and swimming pool, great to look out onto especially on a rainy afternoon.\n\nThe Decor is warm and inviting. Service is friendly and considerate. Great location to order a coffee or two and just work on your laptop without being disturbed.\nRead more\nWritten September 3, 2024",
